I've a PowerStorm4D51T with Open3D installed.
If i've a line:
   :0  Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X -vclass PseudoColor :0
in my /var/dt/Xservers i'd run in 256 color mode.
If i've:
  :0    Local local@console /usr/bin/X11/X  :0
it'd run in truecolor(24 or 32bit) mode.

Mihaly



